[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれがブラオール名物のアイス屋で、\nそれからこっちが名所の占い通り……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's the famous Braulle ice cream shop, and over there's the fortune-telling district...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "目をキラキラさせちゃって。\n私もアイス屋はちょっと気になるけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your eyes are sparkling. I'm kind of curious about that ice cream shop myself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "話に聞いているのと、実際に見るのとでは大違い。\nこれが、本当のブラオール……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hearing about something and actually seeing it are totally different. This is the real Braulle..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふっ……アルビーナも\n元気が戻ってきてよかった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe... I'm glad to see you're back to your usual self, Alvina."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あー、ここ最近、色々あったものね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, you've been through a lot lately."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと、そこのお嬢ちゃん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, you there, young lady."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "占いオババ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fortune-Teller"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん？\u3000私？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm? Me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "違う。その隣の子じゃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, the girl next to you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "占いオババ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fortune-Teller"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、は、はい、なんでしょうか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, y-yes? Can I help you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ、気を付けて。占い広場では勝手に占って\n代金を要求する占い師がいるって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, be careful. I heard there are fortune-tellers in this plaza who read your fortune without asking and then demand payment..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "失礼な、これはタダじゃよ！\nお主、災難の相が出ておるぞよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How rude! This is free! Child, I see the mark of calamity upon you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "占いオババ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fortune-Teller"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "災難の相、ですか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The mark of calamity...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さらには驚きの出会いが待っておるじゃろうが、\n決して呑まれてはいけぬぞよ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Furthermore, a shocking encounter awaits you. But you must not let it overwhelm you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "占いオババ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fortune-Teller"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ありがとうございます……\nって、行っちゃった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Th-thank you... Oh, she's gone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだったんだろ、今の……\nとりあえずぼったくられはしなかったけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What was that about...? At least we didn't get scammed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "彼女はこの占い通り一の占い師。\n人呼んでブラオールのママだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's the best fortune-teller on this street. People call her 'Mama of Braulle.'"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナたち、声がする方へ振り返る",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina and the others turn toward the voice."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかしママはかなりの気分屋で、気が乗らないときは\nいくら金を積んでも占ってくれないというのに珍しいね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But Mama's quite moody—she won't read your fortune no matter how much you pay if she's not in the mood. How unusual."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "珍しいのはその格好なんですけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's unusual is that outfit of yours."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええと……ブラオールにはお詳しいんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um... Are you familiar with Braulle?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだね。俺のシマと言っても過言じゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You could say it's my turf, no exaggeration."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "絶対過言でしょ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's definitely an exaggeration..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……賞金稼ぎのジョゼといえば\nここらじゃ本当に有名なんだけどなあ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...The name José the bounty hunter is really famous around here, you know?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それを知らないって……\nいったいどこから来た御仁たち？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To not know that... Just where did you fine folks come from?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ノーヴァ神聖国。田舎者で悪ぅござんした",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The sacred lands of Nova. Sorry for being country bumpkins."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、あそこか……あの国の教えはどうにも苦手だよ。\n行きすぎているというか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, that place... I'm not fond of their teachings. A bit too extreme, if you ask me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁそれには同意っすね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, I'd agree with that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……おや？\u3000そこの小粋な姉さん、\n前に会ったことない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hm? Say, chic lady over there, haven't we met before?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また随分古臭いナンパの手口だねぇ。\nでもまあ、そうさね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's a pretty old-fashioned pickup line. But well, yeah..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "昔はここらの島を巡ったこともあったから、\nそん時にすれ違ったりでもしたのかもしれないね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I used to travel around these islands back in the day, so maybe we crossed paths then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうかい。こんな強そうな人忘れそうに\nないんだけど。ところで……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that so? I wouldn't forget someone as tough-looking as you. By the way..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこに隠れているのもあんたらのお仲間かい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is the person hiding over there also with you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、あはは……バレちゃった。鋭いね、おじさん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, ahaha... You caught me. Sharp eyes, pops."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おじさん！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pops?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キューン……！\nお前さん、つけてきてたのかい！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn...! You followed us here?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうやら敵じゃないようだね。とんだお節介か。\nじゃあな、ブラオールを楽しんでくれ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Doesn't seem like you're trouble. Looks like there was no cause for concern. Well then, enjoy Braulle."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ……行っちゃいました。\nなんだかちょっと傷ついていたような",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... He left. He seemed a bit hurt."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの、イェルカ姉貴と話したいんだ。\nここじゃなんだから……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um, I want to talk to you, Jelka. Not here though..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……分かった、場所を移して聞こうじゃないか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...All right. Let's go somewhere else to talk."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉貴……お願いだから、マスターの命令に\n従って……この人たちからいったん離れよう？\u3000ね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please, just listen to Master's orders... Part with them, just for now, okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キューン……お前さんは優しいから\nわざわざ説得しに来てくれた――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn... You're too kind to have come all this way just to persuade me—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ってわけじゃなさそうだね。\n何か事情があるようだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though that's not the whole story, is it? Looks like there's more going on."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ごめんなさい。\nじゃなきゃ、私は……っ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm sorry. Otherwise, I...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "力ずくでも、姉貴を連れ帰らなくちゃ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll have to take you back by force!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "力ずくってのは、粋じゃないねぇ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Using force isn't very chic!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]